@title Sword of Mana (USA)
@file Sword of Mana (U) [!].gba
@game AVSE
@chip FLASH512
@status wip: reaches the opening narration after New Game (hero, named "A"); A-mashing then runs a long prologue (narration, the Granz castle-town flashback) and nothing is written to flash along the way. The first save needs the prologue played through to the first save point. A human should record: New Game, hero, name, play to the first save point and save, quit after the save message. [load]: title > the file > resume.

# Title (PUSH START) > NEW GAME > hero > name entry: DOWN to the letters,
# A types "A", START jumps to OK!, A; "Is this okay?" defaults to No, so
# LEFT then A > "This dream again."

[new]
wait 600
press START
wait 720
until text "PUSH START" timeout=900 every=10
checkpoint title
press START
until notext "PUSH" timeout=600 every=10
wait 120
press A
until text "Select a" timeout=600 every=10
wait 60
checkpoint character_select
press A after=120
press A
until text "your character" timeout=600 every=10
wait 60
press A after=60
press DOWN after=15
press A after=15
press A after=15
press START after=30
checkpoint name_entry
press A
until text "okay" timeout=300 every=5
wait 30
press LEFT after=20
press A
until text "dream" timeout=900 every=10
checkpoint prologue
